# Environment Variables

Copy to `.env.local` for local dev:

```
VITE_FORMS_ENDPOINT=https://YOUR-FORMS-API.execute-api.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com
```

Set the same value as GitHub secret `VITE_FORMS_ENDPOINT` for production deploys.

Run `../shift-infra/setup-aws.sh` to provision AWS and auto-fill the forms endpoint.
